---
import { contact } from '../data/content';
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container grid">
    <div class="bio">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading about-heading">Engineer first. Based in Colombo, built for your timezone.</h2>
      <p class="description">
        I'm Dasun Theekshana, an AI engineer with more than 4 years of experience shipping production GenAI for
        US enterprise SaaS. At Altrium (engineering partner of PlanYear LLC), I architected 4+ GenAI products, led a 3-person
        NLP R&amp;D team, and owned LLMOps across the GenAI stack - evals, guardrails, prompt engineering,
        retrieval, and FastAPI services at scale. Winner of Altrium's ACE award for excellence in AI engineering.
        UTC+5:30 means full overlap with the European workday and same-day turnaround for US teams: brief me at
        your end of day, review it your next morning.
      </p>
      <div class="social">
        <a href="https://github.com/dasuntm10">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dasun-theekshana/">LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-card">
      <p class="cta-title">Have a workflow drowning in manual work?</p>
      <p class="cta-description">
        Send me one sentence about it. I'll reply within a day with a 2-minute video of how I'd automate it - no
        call required, no obligation.
      </p>
      <a href={contact.bookingHref} class="btn">Book a 15-minute call</a>
      <p class="cta-footnote">{contact.email} · replies within 24h</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding-top: 96px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 64px;
  }

  .bio {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .about-heading {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 30px);
  }

  .description {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .social {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .social a {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .cta-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 40px;
    align-self: start;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cta-description {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cta-card .btn {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 14px 28px;
  }

  .cta-footnote {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--faint);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .about {
      padding-top: 56px;
    }

    .cta-card {
      padding: 28px 22px;
    }

    .cta-card .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
